---
/**
 * Donate.
 *
 * There is no payment integration yet, and this page says so rather than
 * dressing up a form that cannot take money. A donate page that fails at the
 * last step costs more than one that is honest at the first.
 *
 * Nothing here claims a tax status, a figure, or a proportion. The Foundation
 * has not given me any, and an invented one on this page of all pages is the
 * kind of thing that is never forgiven. When online giving exists, the middle
 * section is what changes; the rest of the page already means what it says.
 */
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
---

<Doc
	title="Donate — The Itti Foundation"
	description="How to give to The Itti Foundation, what the money is for, and what we are still setting up."
	eyebrow="Donate"
	heading="What your giving does."
	lede="Three kinds of work, one place to send it, and an honest account of what we cannot take yet."
>
	<section class="doc__section">
		<h2 class="doc__h">What it pays for</h2>
		<div class="doc__body">
			<p>
				We work on three things, and they are not three campaigns &mdash; they are the
				same conviction three times over: that a person is worth the trouble of being
				understood before they are treated.
			</p>
			<dl class="doc__list">
				<dt>Neurodivergence</dt>
				<dd>
					Assessment that families can afford and reach, and the long unglamorous work
					after it &mdash; the school that needs persuading, the sibling nobody asked
					about, the adult who was never assessed as a child and has spent thirty years
					being told they were careless.
				</dd>
				<dt>Cancer care</dt>
				<dd>
					Catching it early, and standing next to people through what follows. Diagnosis
					is a day; the year after it is transport, childcare, lost wages and somebody to
					explain what was just said in a room where nobody could hear.
				</dd>
				<dt>Conservation</dt>
				<dd>
					The ordinary defence of places that have nobody arguing for
					them. The forest and the person are the same problem: both are cheaper to
					protect than to restore, and both are usually noticed too late.
				</dd>
			</dl>
			<p>
				It also pays for the parts nobody funds &mdash; the phone answered on a Sunday,
				the follow-up six months later, the record kept properly so a family does not have
				to tell their story again from the beginning.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="doc__section">
		<h2 class="doc__h">How to give today</h2>
		<div class="doc__body">
			<p>
				<strong>We cannot take a payment on this page yet.</strong> Online giving is being
				set up, and until it is, saying so is better than a button that goes nowhere.
			</p>
			<p>
				Write to{' '}
				<a class="doc__link" href="mailto:hello@itti.org.in">hello@itti.org.in</a>{' '}
				and we will arrange it directly &mdash; a transfer, a cheque, or whatever is
				easiest at your end. Say roughly what you have in mind and whether you want it to
				go to one of the three in particular. A person answers, within five working days.
			</p>
			<p>
				If you would rather wait until it is one click, that is entirely reasonable.{' '}
				<a class="doc__link" href="/join">Register</a> and we will tell you when it is.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="doc__section">
		<h2 class="doc__h">Other ways, which are not lesser</h2>
		<div class="doc__body">
			<dl class="doc__list">
				<dt>Time</dt>
				<dd>
					Hours from someone who knows what they are doing are worth more to us than the
					money it would take to buy them. Clinicians, teachers, translators, drivers,
					people who are good on the phone.{' '}
					<a class="doc__link" href="/join">Register</a> and say what you can do.
				</dd>
				<dt>Saying it out loud</dt>
				<dd>
					Most people who need us do not know we exist, and they are not reached by
					advertising. They are reached by somebody they already trust mentioning us.
				</dd>
				<dt>Your organisation</dt>
				<dd>
					Partnerships, and companies wanting to do something beyond a cheque at the end
					of the year. Write and say what you have in mind.
				</dd>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="doc__section">
		<h2 class="doc__h">What we will tell you</h2>
		<div class="doc__body">
			<p>
				The Itti Foundation is registered as Itti&rsquo;s Skill School Foundation, a
				Section 8 not-for-profit in India. Ask us what a gift was spent on and we will
				tell you plainly, including the part that went on rent and salaries &mdash; a
				charity that claims none of it did is either lying or about to fold.
			</p>
			<p>
				Ask us about receipts and tax treatment before you give rather than after, and we
				will tell you exactly where we stand at the time. We would rather answer that
				question than have you assume.
			</p>
			<p>
				What we do with your details is set out in{' '}
				<a class="doc__link" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Doc>
